OL,3,CPlans for staged re-opening of
OL,4,Cwildfire cordons nearly complete
OL,6,FPlans for the staged re-opening of a
OL,7,Fwildfire cordon around a village in
OL,8,Fthe Cairngorms are being finalised by
OL,9,Fpolice and fire chiefs.
OL,11,FRoad and access restrictions have
OL,12,Fremained in place around the Glenmore
OL,13,Farea as firefighters continue to
OL,14,Ftackle the ongoing wildfire in the
OL,15,FCairngorms National Park.
OL,17,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,18,F(SFRS) was first notified about a fire
OL,19,Fnear the Ryvoan Bothy, close to
OL,20,FAviemore, around midday on July 15.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
