FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785844079
OL,3,CPlans for staged re-opening of
OL,4,Cwildfire cordons nearly complete
OL,6,FSo far more than 500 firefighters have
OL,7,Fbeen deployed to fight the blaze,
OL,8,Fwhich has devastated an estimated 25
OL,9,Fsquare kilometres of land since it
OL,10,Fstarted.
OL,12,FThe firefighting response remains
OL,13,Fongoing, but SFRS said "good progress"
OL,14,Fis being made.
OL,16,FOn Monday, SFRS said it currently has
OL,17,Fsix fire appliances on site, with
OL,18,Faround 30 firefighters working
OL,19,Falongside partners and helicopter
OL,20,Fsupport to extinguish remaining
OL,21,Fhotspots and deep-seated fires.
OL,26,@uD@XOUuD@fO]
