OL,3,CPlans for staged re-opening of
OL,4,Cwildfire cordons nearly complete
OL,6,FThis includes the use of heavy
OL,7,Fmachinery to clear trees and dig
OL,8,Ftrenches through peat layers to
OL,9,Fprevent underground spread.
OL,11,FOn Monday evening, SFRS said plans for
OL,12,Fa phased reduction of some cordons in
OL,13,Fthe Glenmore area are being finalised
OL,14,Ffollowing a reduction of the incident
OL,15,Fcordon.
OL,17,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
