OL,3,CPlans for staged re-opening of
OL,4,Cwildfire cordons nearly complete
OL,6,FAs part of this managed re-opening,
OL,7,FSFRS said people working at the Refuel
OL,8,Fevent at Badaguish this week and those
OL,9,Fstaying at the event ground will be
OL,10,Fallowed past the existing road
OL,11,Fcheckpoint at Coylumbridge from
OL,12,FTuesday.
OL,14,F"This will allow access as far as
OL,15,FBadaguish, where an incident cordon
OL,16,Fremains in place, and will require
OL,17,Fproof of site access or a valid event
OL,18,Fticket," SFRS said in an update.
OL,26,@vD@AOUzD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
