OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785844079
OL,3,CPlans for staged re-opening of
OL,4,Cwildfire cordons nearly complete
OL,6,F"The multi-agency partnership aims to
OL,7,Fsupport the community and local
OL,8,Fbusinesses. This event will generate
OL,9,Fsignificant footfall in the Aviemore
OL,10,Farea, however public safety must
OL,11,Fremain the top priority.
OL,13,F"Access to and from the event will be
OL,14,Fstrictly managed by event staff to
OL,15,Fprevent further public access into the
OL,16,FGlenmore Forest and Loch Morlich area,
OL,17,Fwhich remains a live incident ground."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUyD@fO]
