CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785844079
OL,3,CPlans for staged re-opening of
OL,4,Cwildfire cordons nearly complete
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said road closures
OL,7,Fremain in place for the C7 Ski Road,
OL,8,Fthe Forest Lodge access road, Lettoch
OL,9,FRoad, and Dorback.
OL,11,FWalking routes around Glenmore, Loch
OL,12,FMorlich and Badaguish also remain
OL,13,Fclosed, alongside of routes providing
OL,14,Faccess to Cairngorm Mountain, the
OL,15,FNorthern Corries, Meall A'
OL,16,FBhuachaille, the Green Loch (Lochan
OL,17,FUaine), Strath Nethy and Bynack More.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
