FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785844079
OL,3,CPlans for staged re-opening of
OL,4,Cwildfire cordons nearly complete
OL,6,FAs cordons are reduced, SFRA said
OL,7,Froutes in and out of the incident area
OL,8,Fwill be fully signposted, with clear
OL,9,Fguidance on what areas are accessible.
OL,11,FInformation on wider access for the
OL,12,Fpublic and local businesses is
OL,13,Fexpected to follow later this week.
OL,15,FHighland Council is hosting drop-in
OL,16,Fsessions for residents and businesses
OL,17,Faffected by the fire to find out what
OL,18,Fsupport is available to them.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
